flowchart TD
  F[FDR options] --> A[AMSupport session options]
  A --> D[Server-trust challenge]
  D --> X{Disable validation true?}
  X -->|Yes| U[Use trust credential]
  X -->|No| R{Custom root data supplied?}
  R -->|No| S[Framework default handling]
  R -->|Yes| C[Parse supplied certificates]
  C --> H[Compare leaf DER or verify direct issuer]
  H -->|Accepted| U
  H -->|Failure| E[Set failure flag and cancel]
